((((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "vss") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " /m ") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " /y "))) AND ((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\esentutl.exe")) OR (where(OriginalFileName = "\\esentutl.exe")))) OR ((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\config\\RegBack\\sam") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\config\\RegBack\\security") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\config\\RegBack\\system") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\config\\sam") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\config\\security") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\config\\system ") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\repair\\sam") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\repair\\security") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\repair\\system") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\windows\\ntds\\ntds.dit"))))
